  "rationale": "The requirement says each bundled skill, recognized by its front matter, is a site. `assets/skills/habeas-refactor/SKILL.md` has `name` and `description` front matter, so the requirement applies to it.\n\nThe only obligation is that each link to a file holding specialized material must say when to read that file. `assets/skills/habeas-refactor/SKILL.md` has no markdown links and no links to other files. Its mentions of the `habeas-evidence` and `habeas-requirements` skills, and of `habeas author --force`, are prose references. They are not links to files. The skill puts no material in linked files, so the obligation is met vacuously. The requirement's MAY clause imposes nothing to check. I found no violation matches or gaps.",
